[engl]
{100}{}{none}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Show}
{2000}{}{Before the needle, there is only the quiet hum of desperation and the hope of becoming more. After, the mind is the first battlefield. The drug doesn't just change the body; it hijacks the brain. The initial rush isn't euphoria, but a tidal wave of pure, unfiltered information.@@Your own thoughts are drowned out by a cascade of alien instincts, predatory hungers, and sensory data you have no context for.@@First comes the tingling, a pins-and-needles sensation that radiates from the injection site, not like a limb falling asleep, but like a million tiny insects burrowing under your skin. It's a deep, cellular itch you can't scratch.@@The cold spreads, a wave of arctic frost washing through your torso, down your legs, up into your skull. Just as you're sure you'll freeze from the inside out, the fire ignites. It’s a fever that boils the marrow, a heat so intense your vision whites out.@@Your own heartbeat becomes a deafening, painful drum. You can feel your own anatomy shifting-a joint popping where no joint should be, the strange sensation of new vertebrae clicking into place along your spine, the phantom feeling of an organ that didn't exist an hour ago humming to life deep within your gut.@@It starts with the sharp, sterile prick, a pinpoint of reality in a haze of desperation. Then, the pressure. A slow, deliberate push as the plunger forces the change into you. The liquid itself feels alien, not warm like blood, but a thick, crawling cold that invades the vein.}
{2010}{}{[Sit back and reflect on the past]}
{2020}{}{[Clench your teeth and fists. Force yourself back to reality]}
{3000}{}{You sit back and reflect on your past actions, your childhood, the ways Karma have affected you.  You were told that the only way to get rid of your Karma is to fulfll it.  But what about your self awareness, moments like these..}
{3010}{}{If I would become to be less like this... [Remove Traits]}
{3020}{}{If I would become to be more like this... [Add Traits]}
{3030}{}{If I would focus less on this... [Remove Perks]}
{3040}{}{If I would focus more on this... [Add Perks]}
{3050}{}{Is that a tree growing on my head? This radiation is killing me... [Change S.P.E.C.I.A.L.]}
{3060}{}{Hm, Small Guns... they are so small. [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3070}{}{Are really Flamers my thing? [Change Tagged Skill]@@Is it really the Bozar that I dream of? [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3080}{}{Is it really the Laser Riffle that I love the most? [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3090}{}{Getting up close and personal with all the mutated abominations in the wastland? Really? [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3100}{}{Do I really want to gather all the knives and spears I throw at people? [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3110}{}{Dealing with crippled people all the time... depressing! [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3120}{}{Let's just enter the front door this time. With guns blazing of course! [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3130}{}{Traps. Bah. Who am I? Some hobo from Kalamath? [Change Tagged Skill]}
{3140}{}{[Back]}
{4000}{}{That was never really me! It was just an illusion...@lex removableTraits@}
